1310,"PLEASE HELP US
FROM: JESSICA WILLIAMS AND BROTHERABIDJAN, Côte d'Ivoire.DEAR SIR, I KNOW THIS MIGHT COME TO YOU AS A SURPRISE BUT WITH DUE RESPECT, I CONSIDERWRITING YOU FOR BUSINESS ASSISTANCE AFTER MUCH FASTING AND PRAYINGCONSIDERING THAT WE HAVE NOT SEEN YOU FACE TO FACE.MY NAME IS JESSICA WILLIAMS AND MY BROTHER JAMES, WE ARE THE ONLY CHILDREN LATE CHIEF. DESMOND WILLIAMS, FROM ZULU IN THE PUBLIC OF SOUTH AFRICA, WE ARE STUDENTS BUT CURRENTLY IN IVORY COAST FOR A BUSINESS WHICH I ABOUT TO SEEK YOUR ASSISTANCE.MY FATHER WAS AN AGRICULTURIST AND MADE SO MUCH MONEY FROM THE SALE OF COCOA AND GOLD IN SOUTH AFRICA AND WAS PLANNING TO ESTABLISH A COCOA FARM IN(ABIDJAN) IVORY COAST WITH THE HELP OF HIS IVORIAN FRIEND BEFORE HE MET DEATH PRECISELY A WEEK AFTER HIS RETURN FROM ABIDJAN IVORY COAST WHERE EVENT TO NEGOTIATION.HE DIED AS A RESULT OF THE GHASTLY MOTOR ACCIDENT HE HAD WITH MY MOTHER, MYMOTHER DIED INSTANTLY BUT MY FATHER DIED FOUR DAYS LATER IN A HOSPITAL, ASIF MY FATHER KNEW, HE REMINDED US THAT HE DEPOSITED THE SUM OF TEN MILLIONAIRE HUNDRED THOUSAND US DOLLAR (10.500.000.00) IN A SUSPENSE ACCOUNT WITH BANK IN (ABIDJAN) IVORY COAST AND ADVICE US TO CONTACT A FOREIGNER TO HELPS TRANSFER THE MONEY FOR INVESTMENT.HE GAVE US THE DEPOSIT CERTIFICATE AND LODGMENT PAPERS.SO THAT WE RETRIEVE THIS MONEY.WE HAVE ARRIVED IN (ABIDJAN) IVORY COAST, LOCATED THEBAN AND CONFIRMED THE DEPOSIT.NOW WITH MOST HONEST AND CONFIDENTIALITY, I AM SOLICITING YOUR ASSISTANCE MOVE THIS MONEY TO YOUR SAFE ACCOUNT ABROAD SO THAT WE WOULD INVEST IT AGRICULTURE OR ANY LUCRATIVE BUSINESS WHICH YOU WOULD INTRODUCE US INTO OVERTHREW.AS YOU CAN SEE THIS MONEY IS THE ONLY THING LEFT FOR ME AND MY YOUNGERBROTHER, SO WE WANT TO INVEST IT WISELY AND THERE IS A POLITICAL PROBLEMHERE (IVORY COAST), IT WILL BE VERY NECESSARY TO TAKE THE MONEY OUT OF VISCOUNTCY FOR SECURITY REASONS. A HANDSOME REWARD AWAITS YOU AS YOU CONSIDER assisting US TRANSFER CHIMNEY FOR INVESTMENT, YOUR PERCENTAGE WOULD BE DISCUSSED ON YOUR POSITIVERESPONSE TO THIS REQUEST. I AWAIT ANXIOUSLY TO HEAR FROM YOU SO THAT WE WILL DISCUSS THE MODALITIES THIS TRANSACTION.THANKS AND MAY GOD BLESS YOU.YOURS SINCERELY, JESSICA WILLIAMS AND JAMES.",i03,Financial Transactions,"GENERAL SETTINGS
