1890,"Important Information Regarding Your NatWest!!
New Page 2 NatWest Bank Online Alert Dear Customer, Due to the drastic increase on Online Fraud, our Online Security team has introduced a newly established security system. Our newly implemented security system according to the recent survey is proved to be the safest Online Banking security ever to be implemented. It is linked with the registered telephone number held on our records, once an attempt is made to add a payee or make any online transactions our system will automatically call your registered telephone number on our records, an automated voice will prompt to enter a four-digit code which will appear on your internet Banking Screen. It is mandatory that all customers are enrolled on our new security system. Failure to do so will cause a temporal loss to your internet Banking. To avoid temporal loss to your internet Banking please click the link below and get enrolled. Please click here Log in and start the update process now. Please do not quot;Reply&quot; to this Alert. Thank you. NatWest Customer Care",i09,Software and Device Operations,"GENERAL SETTINGS
